iv class=\"p-flavortext\">This mallet seems almost anxious to hit something.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This item can be obtained by asking <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnominimus\">Gnominimus</a> to put together its three parts: a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mallet%20Pommel\">Mallet Pommel</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mallet%20Handle\">Mallet Handle</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mallet%20Head\">Mallet Head</a>.\n</p><p>Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/dangerous-depths-quest\">Dangerous Depths Quest</a>. When used on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Gong\">Gong</a> you will hear a <span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">BOOOOOOOONG!</span> and the Mallet will be destroyed.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-object-proficiency\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Weapon_Proficiency\">Weapon Proficiency</span></h3>\n<div class=\"weapon_proficiency weapon_proficiency_border\">\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_number_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Attack Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+1 attack</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Attack Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<